&lt;p&gt;Binance is committed to being an equal opportunity employer. We believe that having a diverse workforce is fundamental to our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting a job application, you acknowledge that you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.binance.com/en/candidate/privacy/notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
